{"id":51286,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51286"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:25:02","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:25:02","slug":"furia-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/furia-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"3\u00ba F\u00faria Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">3\u00ba F\u00faria Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>3\u00ba F\u00faria Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>7 e 8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na pitoresca vila de <strong>Freixianda<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Our\u00e9m<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Promovido pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Recreativa Vale do Nab\u00e3o (ACRVN)<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Our\u00e9m<\/strong> e da Junta de Freguesia local, o evento celebra os encantos naturais e a hospitalidade da verdejante regi\u00e3o do Vale do Nab\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e secretariado no centro da Freixianda, o programa abre no s\u00e1bado (07\/11) \u00e0s <strong>17h00<\/strong> com as divertidas provas gratuitas do <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong>, e culmina no domingo (08\/11) com o <strong>Trail Curto (21 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini-Trail (14 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h45<\/strong>, a <strong>Experi\u00eancia Trail (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h10<\/strong>. Todos os atletas usufruem de t-shirt oficial, pr\u00e9mio finisher, banhos no Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo e um concorrido churrasco conv\u00edvio gratuito no final.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-wor